<p>A fire tore through a nightclub in Kehl early Sunday, prompting the evacuation of about 750 people who were inside at the time. Police said the blaze began at about 3:45 a.m. and spread through the entire building. Everyone inside got out safely.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Roof blaze: Images from the scene showed flames tearing across the building’s roof as emergency crews responded.</li><li>Building loss: Tagesschau said the nightclub burned down, pointing to severe damage to the venue itself.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Emergency services: Responders treated three people for shock after the evacuation, suggesting the immediate medical toll was limited. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3348323/hundreds-flee-fire-rips-through-german-nightclub'>South China Morning Post</a>, <a href='https://www.tagesschau.de/inland/regional/badenwuerttemberg/feuer-in-club-in-kehl-100.html'>Tagesschau</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/29/hundreds-evacuated-as-fire-rips-through-german-nightclub'>Hundreds evacuated as fire rips through German nightclub</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3348323/hundreds-flee-fire-rips-through-german-nightclub'>Hundreds flee as fire rips through German nightclub</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.tagesschau.de/inland/regional/badenwuerttemberg/feuer-in-club-in-kehl-100.html'>A nightclub burns down in Kehl, Baden-Württemberg, Germany. All 750 people inside were evacuated, three of whom are treated for shock. (Tagesschau)</a> - tagesschau.de</li></ul>